# write(0), wait 400 ms, write(180), wait 500 ms, write(0). The first pulse is at
# about 53 ms. write(0) is 544 us, just inside the 500 us stop, so the shaft sits
# a few degrees off that end. By 250 ms it is there and the 5 V diode is at idle.
# By 550 ms it is slewing toward 180°. A run shows the 5 V pin at 4.757 V while
# the shaft holds and 4.703 V while it moves, and the slew at 490 deg/s, behind
# the 500 deg/s figure at 4.8 V. By 800 ms it is there.
open
step 250ms
expect @servo.angle > 3deg
expect @servo.angle < 6deg
expect @nano.diode.i < 40mA
step 300ms
expect @servo.angle > 55deg
expect @servo.angle < 75deg
expect @nano.diode.i > 100mA
step 250ms
expect @servo.angle > 179deg
expect no diagnostics
